OL,3,GNEWSACar torched in deliberate fire
OL,4,Aamid fears of rising gangland violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a deliberate
OL,7,Fcar fire at a garage near Glasgow amid
OL,8,Ffears of a fresh wave of gangland
OL,9,Fviolence in the city.
OL,11,FThe vehicle was torched at Kelvinside
OL,12,FMotor Company in Kirkintilloch at 22:55
OL,13,Fon Saturday, days after officers
OL,14,Fattended a "disturbance" at the same
OL,15,Fproperty.
OL,17,FThe garage was previously targeted in a
OL,18,Ffire attack in April last year, which
OL,19,Fpolice investigated as part of its
OL,20,FOperation Portaledge gangland probe.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
