OL,3,GNEWSACar torched in deliberate fire
OL,4,Aamid fears of rising gangland violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said there were "no
OL,7,Freported injuries" in the latest
OL,8,Fincident and officers were keeping an
OL,9,Fopen mind over links to Operation
OL,10,FPortaledge.
